\f0\fs22\pard\sa120
Wilco uses these open-source packages and models.\par
\b FluidAudio\b0  (Apache License 2.0). Runs Parakeet on the Neural Engine. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "https://github.com/FluidInference/FluidAudio"}{\fldrslt github.com/FluidInference/FluidAudio}}\par
\b WhisperKit\b0  (MIT License). Runs Whisper on device. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "https://github.com/argmaxinc/WhisperKit"}{\fldrslt github.com/argmaxinc/WhisperKit}}\par
\b NVIDIA Parakeet TDT 0.6B v3\b0  (CC-BY-4.0). {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "https://huggingface.co/nvidia/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3"}{\fldrslt huggingface.co/nvidia/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3}}\par
\b NVIDIA Parakeet CTC 110M\b0  (CC-BY-4.0). {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "https://huggingface.co/nvidia/parakeet-ctc-110m"}{\fldrslt huggingface.co/nvidia/parakeet-ctc-110m}}\par
\b Speaker diarization Community-1 models\b0  (CC-BY-4.0). The WeSpeaker speaker-embedding model and FBank, segmentation and PLDA files from pyannote's speaker-diarization-community-1, with PLDA parameters from BUT Speech@FIT, modified as Core ML conversions by Fluid Inference. Used to tell voices apart. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "https://huggingface.co/FluidInference/speaker-diarization-coreml"}{\fldrslt huggingface.co/FluidInference/speaker-diarization-coreml}}, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "https://huggingface.co/pyannote/speaker-diarization-community-1"}{\fldrslt huggingface.co/pyannote/speaker-diarization-community-1}}, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "https://github.com/wenet-e2e/wespeaker"}{\fldrslt github.com/wenet-e2e/wespeaker}}, licence {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"}{\fldrslt creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0}}\par
